WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A small weight hangs from a thread. You think of a circle.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
It begins to move. You do not remember telling your hand to move.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Small muscular changes can accumulate into a visible swing.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The movement is real. The interpretation is still a hypothesis.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Researchers test conditions and compare purported answers with ordinary guesses.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A pendulum can move without knowing. Inspect the evidence.
